   "design": "Travel times from the road authority's floating car data give speeds through the delay area on routes the feed covers, so fewer timing runs are driven. Observing delays, counting vehicles affected, typing sheets, analysis, the note and the engineer talk stay with the technician.",
   "approvals": [],
   "previous_blocker": "Speeds through delay areas came only from timing runs.",
   "enabler_now": "Floating car travel time data.",
   "still_hard": "Delays on minor roads the feed does not cover.",
   "human_edge": "Seeing what causes a queue, not only how long it is.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
   },
   "altitude": "Fewer timing runs; observation stays.",
   "reach": [
    {
     "role": "traffic engineer",
     "task": "Reduce delays",
     "learn": "Whether delay data cover more days."
    }
   ],
